          "fullyHighlighted": false,
          "matchLevel": "full",
          "matchedWords": [
            "startup"
          ],
          "value": "Can someone please create CRAZY as a Service!<p>For those old enough to remember MAD (Mutually Assured Destruction), it is time to become CRAZY (Cyber Recursive Annihilation, Zeroing Yottabtyes of data) - the digital successor.<p>Being able to ensure that if our data is deleted, then the data of our enemies is also deleted _without_ us doing anything.<p>This sounds crazy but so was MAD. I wonder whether the various secret services around the world are already working on such systems and whether the next Unicorn <em>startup</em> could be a AI-driven predictive preemptive protection service. The idea would be to delete the data of our enemies before they can delete our data based on predictive AI.<p>That is, to delete our enemies data just before they think of deleting our data. And that's were the (holistic) predictive AI comes in: to predict when our enemies _thinks_ of deleting our data.<p>Instructive for such an endeavor would be Dr. Strangelove."
